    "description": "SYS Holdings Co., Ltd., together with its subsidiaries, provides information technology services in Japan and internationally. It operates through Global-Manufacturing Solution, Social Information Infrastructure Solution, and Mobile Solution business segments. The company offers information services to the automobiles, heavy industry, machine tools, steel, and conveying equipment; social information infrastructure solutions include energy, electricity, gas, finance, life insurance, credit cards, leasing, securities, and printing; and mobile applications for distribution, home care, railways, medical sectors. It also offers information technologies, such as finance and control services; cloud and web services; automotive ECU and reliability evaluation testing services; IT infrastructure design, web development, ICT support, and outsourcing services; and project management office and business process outsourcing services. In addition, the company constructs industrial air conditioner embedded technology and business systems; develops image-related software, and infrastructure construction and middleware; develops and operates E-commerce site; and offers engine control units, warehouse management systems, and transportation management system. SYS Holdings Co., Ltd., was founded in 1991 and is headquartered in Nagoya, Japan."
